'''Take Me Out''' (真夏の甲子園, ''Manatsu no Kōshien'', '''Midsummer Baseball Championship''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

